<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIA TAKE 3-0 DAVIS CUP LEAD OVER FRANCE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIA TAKE 3-0 DAVIS CUP LEAD OVER FRANCE.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia won the doubles match in the Davis Cup world group first round tie against France at White City on Saturday:</p>
<p>Todd Woodbridge/Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat Guy Forget/Guillaume Raoux (France) 7-6 (8-6) 6-4 6-3.</p>
<p>Australia have an unbeatable 3-0 lead.</p>
</text>
